    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
routers/courses.py
--
FastAPI router for course endpoints
--
+ courses_router: APIRouter
--
POST   /courses/
GET    /courses/
GET    /courses/{id}
PUT    /courses/{id}
DELETE /courses/{id}
POST   /courses/{id}/semesters/{sem_id}
DELETE /courses/{id}/semesters/{sem_id}
GET    /courses/unassigned-semesters
--
Pattern: Controller (API Router)
Uses CourseManager service
Dependency injection: Depends(get_session)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>456</x>
      <y>136</y>
      <w>320</w>
      <h>240</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
routers/subjects.py
--
FastAPI router for subject endpoints
--
+ router: APIRouter
--
GET    /subjects/
POST   /subjects/
GET    /subjects/{code}/{sem}/{year}
PUT    /subjects/{code}/{sem}/{year}
DELETE /subjects/{code}/{sem}/{year}
--
Pattern: Controller (API Router)
Uses models directly with JOINs
Validates semester existence
Dependency injection: Depends(get_session)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>816</x>
      <y>136</y>
      <w>320</w>
      <h>240</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
routers/assignments.py
routers/exams.py
routers/semesters.py
--
FastAPI routers for other entities
--
Assignment endpoints (CRUD)
Examination endpoints (CRUD)
Semester endpoints (CRUD)
--
Pattern: Controller (API Router)
Uses normalized schema with JOINs
Validates foreign key relationships
Type-safe parameter handling</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1176</x>
      <y>136</y>
      <w>360</w>
      <h>240</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - Web&gt;&gt;
views.py + web/*.py
--
Jinja2 template-based web interface
--
+ views: APIRouter (for HTMX endpoints)
--
Key modules:
- views.py: Main routes, subject lookup
- semester_views.py: Semester detail pages
- course_views.py: Course management
- assignment_views.py: Assignment forms
- exam_views.py: Exam management
- subject_views.py: Subject detail pages
--
Pattern: MVC (Controller + View)
Uses Service Layer for business logic
Returns rendered HTML (HTMX + Tailwind)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1576</x>
      <y>136</y>
      <w>280</w>
      <h>200</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
deps.py
--
FastAPI dependency providers
--
+ get_session() → Generator[Session]
--
Pattern: Dependency Injection
Provides DB session to API routes
Ensures session lifecycle management
(Created per request, auto-closed)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1576</x>
      <y>376</y>
      <w>280</w>
      <h>240</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Presentation Layer - API&gt;&gt;
schemas.py
--
Pydantic request/response models
--
+ SubjectCreate / SubjectRead
+ AssignmentCreate / AssignmentRead
+ ExaminationCreate / ExaminationRead
+ SemesterCreate / SemesterRead
--
Pattern: DTO (Data Transfer Object)
Separates API contracts from ORM models
Enables validation and serialization
Uses Pydantic v2 model_config</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>816</x>
      <y>760</y>
      <w>360</w>
      <h>224</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Application Entry&gt;&gt;
main.py
--
FastAPI application initialization
--
+ app: FastAPI
+ lifespan(app): AsyncContextManager
--
Responsibilities:
- Create DB tables (startup)
- Configure Jinja2 environment
- Mount API routers (versioned /api/v1)
- Mount web routers (/)
- Serve static files (/static, /assets)
- Session middleware
- Health check endpoint (/healthz)
--
Pattern: Application Factory
Orchestrates all layers</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
